jpegtran-js — licence
=====================

This software is based in part on the work of the Independent JPEG Group.

The WebAssembly module in this repository is a build of the Independent JPEG
Group's libjpeg, release 10, together with that release's `transupp.c` transform
engine. The libjpeg sources themselves are not vendored here; `build.sh` copies
them from a libjpeg source tree and compiles them to WebAssembly.

The licence below is reproduced verbatim from the "LEGAL ISSUES" section of the
libjpeg README, release 10, 25-Jan-2026. It is unaltered. The libjpeg sources,
including that README, are distributed with the libjpeg release itself.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
(verbatim copy of the libjpeg README, release 10, section "LEGAL ISSUES")
