------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Additions and changes made by this project
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Condition (1) requires that additions, deletions and changes to the original
files be clearly indicated. This repository adds files next to the unmodified
libjpeg sources rather than editing them:

  - `src/meshviewer_rotate.c` — new. A thin wrapper around the libjpeg and
    transupp APIs (`jpeg_mem_src`, `jpeg_mem_dest`, `jtrans_*`,
    `jcopy_markers_*`). Original work of this project, not IJG code.
  - `index.mjs` — new. JavaScript API around the compiled module.
  - `build.sh`, `test.mjs`, `test/simple.mjs` — new. Build and test tooling.

The libjpeg and transupp sources are used unmodified. `jpeg/` is a throwaway
build copy of the libjpeg source tree, regenerated by `build.sh` and not
distributed with this repository.

The `transupp.c` transform engine originates from the IJG libjpeg distribution,
where it is copyright (C) 1991-2026, Thomas G. Lane, Guido Vollbeding, under the
same terms as above.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Other bundled material
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  - Emscripten 6.0.9 is used as the build toolchain (system package, not
    vendored). It is licensed under the MIT/University of Illinois licence.
  - `test/fixtures/lenna.jpg` is the classical Lenna test image, used here only
    as a sample photograph for the smoke test. Its copyright is not held by
    this project and it is not covered by the licence above; it is included for
    testing purposes only.
